---
type: readme
title: Payment redirect test data README
summary: Explains that the webpay payment method on the david.example.test host redirects to the frank.example.test host, mirroring how real-world payment domains redirect between their own subdomains.
---

The payment method https://david.example.test/webpay redirects to
https://frank.example.test/webpay, similar to how https://google.com/pay
redirects to https://pay.google.com/about.
